# OmniWM skhd bindings — intentionally empty.
#
# skhdrc .loads this file whenever OmniWM is enabled, but skhd grabs keys at the
# event-tap level even when OmniWM isn't the active WM — so any bind here shadows
# the active WM's own hotkeys. Leave it empty (OmniWM uses internal hotkeys)
# until the rig only loads a WM's binds when that WM is active/default.
